            "heading": "Our Name",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_XhjWG7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Befittingly, the dictionary describes the word <strong>channel</strong> as “<em>a way of making a product, information, etc. available; a passage for water or other liquids to flow along; a part of a river or other area of water that is deep and wide enough to provide a route for ships to travel along; and to direct something into a particular place or situation.</em>”</p><p>Expressly, we are steadfast in living up to our name, making Channel International Enterprises a company that would be exactly as what it denotes - a conduit for technologies and multi-media industries, making all the products readily available and easily accessible.</p><p></p><p>We are not only set on providing outstanding products and services to our clients, above all, to a simple yet huge commitment of becoming a <strong>CHANNEL OF BLESSING</strong> to everyone and every place we are linked up. We set our hearts to it, hence our name – <strong>CHANNEL</strong>.</p>"
